hpc:Host a owl:Class .
hpc:IPAddress rdf:type xsd:string .
hpc:Alias rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:hasIPAddress rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:Node rdf:type owl:Class .
hpc:NodeRange rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:hasNodeRange rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .

hpc:Host a owl:Class .
hpc:Ipaddress rdfs:domain hpc:Host .
hpc:Alias rdfs:domain hpc:Host .
hpc:Hasipaddress rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:Hasipaddress rdfs:domain hpc:Host .

hpc:Node a owl:Class .
hpc:Noderange rdfs:domain hpc:Node .
hpc:hasNodeRange rdf:type xsd:string .


This ontology fragment defines classes for Host and Node, and object properties for Alias and NodeRange. It also defines datatype properties for hasIPAddress and hasNodeRange. The Host class is a subclass of NamedEntity, and the Node class is also a subclass of NamedEntity. The properties have their domains and ranges defined as well.
